cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Open Science Infrastructure Self-Assessment Tool
abstract: >-
  A self-assessment tool for Open Science infrastructures against six
  community assessment frameworks: the Principles of Open Scholarly
  Infrastructure (POSI) v2.0, SPII, the Global Open Research Commons (GORC)
  International Model, the FAIR Guiding Principles, the Barcelona
  Declaration on Open Research Information (BD), and an adaptation of the
  open science resilience model (OSR).
type: software
